Use DXE/BDS anchors per boot cycle before accepting a boot handoff. Keep
unmapped platform bytes unknown instead of applying generic AMI errors.
Intel memory names are reference meanings, not verified GNR-D mappings.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD POST sequence policy]

